              "text": "The next bearing is written in the stars. Look for the northern light.",
              "path": "/player/playthroughs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000cd11/journal",
              "meaning": "The canonical published spatial attachment presents its actual released clue without substituting a role label or service result.",
              "state": "LENS_READY",
              "feedbackBoundary": true
            },
            {
              "action": "assert",
              "role": "dialog",
              "name": "A message between worlds",
              "text": "Guided View"
            },
            {
              "action": "click",
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Inspect"
            },
            {
              "action": "assert",
              "kind": "outcome",
              "role": "article",
              "name": "A parchment note bearing the Captain’s next clue.",
              "text": "You are inspecting The Captain’s note.",
              "path": "/player/playthroughs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000cd11/journal",
              "meaning": "Inspection changes the visible canonical entity state and records a meaningful Lens interaction independently from Voyage progression.",
              "state": "INSPECTED",
              "feedbackBoundary": true
            },
            {
              "action": "click",
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Close Chronicle Lens"
            },
            {
              "action": "assert",
              "role": "navigation",
              "name": "Journal tools",
              "path": "/player/playthroughs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000cd11/journal",
              "absentRole": {
                "role": "dialog",
                "name": "A message between worlds"
              },
              "returnPath": true,
              "state": "RETURNED"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
